From: Djair Guilherme <djair.jr@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ion: port the Sophgo/Cvitek staging ION to Linux 7.2 (out of tree)

Vendor 5.10 drivers/staging/android/ion (core + carveout heap + cvitek
glue) built as one module, cvi_ion.ko, for a kernel without ION. See the
"7.2 port" comments.
